function HTMLHelpMain()
    DialogWindow.HelpMain = [[<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><title>Help</title>]] .. Style() .. [[
<body>
  <div class="layout">
    <div class="lookups" id="SideMenuBox">
      <div><input id="InquiryHelp08" class="LuaButton" name="InquiryHelp08" type="button" value="Overview"></div>
      <div><input id="InquiryHelp00" class="LuaButton" name="InquiryHelp00" type="button" value="Main Menu"></div>
      <div><input id="InquiryHelp01" class="LuaButton" name="InquiryHelp01" type="button" value="About"></div>
      <div><input id="InquiryHelp02" class="LuaButton" name="InquiryHelp02" type="button" value="Project Setup"></div>
      <div><input id="InquiryHelp03" class="LuaButton" name="InquiryHelp03" type="button" value="Layers Setup"></div>
      <div><input id="InquiryHelp04" class="LuaButton" name="InquiryHelp04" type="button" value="Milling Defaults"></div>
      <div><input id="InquiryHelp05" class="LuaButton" name="InquiryHelp05" type="button" value="Import Job"></div>
      <div><input id="InquiryHelp06" class="LuaButton" name="InquiryHelp06" type="button" value="Bill Of Materials"></div>
      <div><input id="InquiryHelp07" class="LuaButton" name="InquiryHelp07" type="button" value="Definitions"></div>
   </div>
     <div class="maininfo" id="MainInfoBox">
      <div class="h2-lP">
        <label>Blum Drawer Maker Help</label>
      </div>
      <div class="h1-help">
        <p>This page gives a general description of the gadget. Each of the other pages gives the details of one menu.
        Click a button on the left to open a page.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="helpimagesTop"><]] .. Image1() .. [[ width="570" /></div>
        <div class="h1-help">
          <p>Blum Drawer Maker is a gadget for Vectric Aspire, VCarve Pro and Cut2D Pro, version 11 and later.</p>
          <p>You enter the dimensions of the drawer opening and the thickness of the material. The gadget calculates
          all drawer parts from these values. It makes these items:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>A drawing of each drawer part.</li>
            <li>The toolpaths that cut the parts.</li>
            <li>A cut list in three file formats: .csv, .dat and .html.</li>
            <li>An export file (.lua) that contains all of your settings.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Use the Main Menu to set the drawer dimensions and the bits. Use the other menus to set the joint style,
          the bottom style and the default values.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <hr />
      <div class="h2-lP">
        <label>Joint styles</label>
      </div>
      <div class="h1-help">
        <p>The gadget joins the front panel to the side panels with box joints. A box joint can be a through joint or
        a blind joint.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="helpimages"><]] .. Image2() ..
                                [[ title="Through Joint" alt="Through Joint"  width="250" /></div>
        <div class="h2-lP">
          <label>Through joints</label>
        </div>
        <div class="h1-help">
          <p>In a through joint, the end grain of the fingers shows on the front panel and on the side panels. This is
          the most usual type of box joint.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="helpimages"><]] .. Image3() ..
                                [[ title="Blind Joint" alt="Blind Joint" width="250" /></div>
        <div class="h2-lP">
          <label>Blind joints</label>
        </div>
        <div class="h1-help">
          <p>In a blind joint, the gadget keeps a thin layer of material on the panel. This layer covers the end grain
          of the fingers. Use a blind joint for a modern appearance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="h1-help">
          <p>There are three relief styles: Dog Bone, T-Bone and Sniglet. Each relief style is available as a through
          joint or a blind joint. Thus, there are six joint styles. There is one bottom style: a captive bottom in a
          dado.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
  </div>
  <div class="foot" id="FooterBox">
    <div> <hr /> </div>
    <div align="center"> <input id="ButtonOK" class="FormButton" name="ButtonOK" type="button" value="Close" /> </div>
  </div>
</body>
  </html>]]
    return true
end -- Function End
-- ====================================================]]
function Style()
    return [[<style>
    .FormButton {
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 12px;
        white-space: nowrap;
        background-color: #663300;
        color: #FFFFFF;
    }

    .LuaButton {
        font-weight: bold;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        font-size: 12px;
        background-color: #663300;
        color: #FFFFFF;
    }

    table {
        width: 100%;
        border: 0;
    }

    .h1-help {
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        font-size: 14px;
        text-align: left;
        padding-right: 4px;
        padding-left: 4px;
    }

    .h2-lP {
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: bold;
        text-align: left;
        padding-top: 4px;
        padding-right: 8px;
        padding-left: 18px;
    }

    .h3-lP {
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: bold;
        text-align: left;
        padding-top: 18px;
        padding-right: 8px;
        padding-left: 18px;
    }

    .layout {
        background-color: white;
        color: #000000;
    }

    .lookups {
        position: absolute;
        color: #000000;
        top: 1em;
        width: 12em;
        height: 44em;
        padding-left: 1px;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    #InquiryHelp00 {
        width: 112px;
    }

    #InquiryHelp01 {
        width: 112px;
    }

    #InquiryHelp02 {
        width: 112px;
    }

    #InquiryHelp03 {
        width: 112px;
    }

    #InquiryHelp04 {
        width: 112px;
    }

    #InquiryHelp05 {
        width: 112px;
    }

    #InquiryHelp06 {
        width: 112px;
    }

    #InquiryHelp07 {
        width: 112px;
    }

    #InquiryHelp08 {
        width: 112px;
    }

    #InquiryHelp09 {
        width: 112px;
    }

    .maininfo {
        position: absolute;
        top: 14px;
        left: 131px;
        color: #000000;
        width: 52em;
        height: 44em;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        overflow: auto;
    }

    .foot {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 1em;
        width: 62em;
    }

    .helpimagesTop {
        float: left;
        margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px;
    }

    .helpimages {
        float: left;
        margin: 10px 90px 20px 10px;
    }

    .helpimagesFooter {
        float: right;
        margin: 10px 260px 1px 10px;
    }

    body {
        background-color: #3a4660;
        background-position: center;
        overflow: hidden;
        font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #FFFFFF;
        background-image: url(]] .. DialogWindow.myBackGround .. [[);
    }

    html {
        overflow: hidden
    }
</style>]]
end

